# vergeio_nas_nfs_share (Resource)

`vergeio_nas_nfs_share` is an NFS share on a `vergeio_nas_volume`. Set `volume_id` to that volume id so Terraform removes this share before the volume.

`allowed_hosts` is a comma separated list. If creating the share succeeds and a later read fails, Terraform deletes the share so it cannot block volume destroy.

